uare" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="r" indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="14284B"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>15</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="Text 3"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="548640" y="6428232"/><a:ext cx="7315200" cy="219456"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l" indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="850" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="8A8A8A"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Informational estimate only — not medical or dietary advice.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="850" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="6" name="Text 4"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="548640" y="1170432"/><a:ext cx="11094415" cy="237744"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="ctr" indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" i="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="666666"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>System Specifications: Core Functional Capabilities and Non-Functional Engineering Standards</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="7" name="Shape 5"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="548640" y="1444752"/><a:ext cx="5440680" cy="4206240"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="roundRect"><a:avLst><a:gd name="adj" fmla="val 870"/></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F8F9FA"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="CBD5E1"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="Text 6"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="1554480"/><a:ext cx="5111496" cy="310896"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="14284B"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Functional Requirements (System Capabilities)</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="9" name="Text 7"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="1901952"/><a:ext cx="5111496" cy="3675888"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Multi-Component Segmentation: Decomposes mixed plates into 3–8 discrete items with bounding regions, physical states (raw, cooked, gravy, fried), and visibility flags. The VLM emits labels and coordinates only, never calorie numbers or grams.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Scale-Anchored Portioning: Detects plate diameter or reference object to establish real-world scale (px/cm); computes projected area, applies category volume/heap factors, and maps density to grams with an 80 % log-normal confidence interval.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Knowledge-Base Retrieval (RAG): Matches components against IFCT 2017 &amp; USDA FDC using hybrid dense (bge-small) + BM25 search with Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF, k=60); enforces physical-state filtering and rejects matches below 0.55 similarity.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Deterministic Nutrition Arithmetic: Pure Python calculation scaling database nutrients by estimated mass outside the LLM (kJ ÷ 4.184 = kcal); missing values remain null and are never coerced to zero.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Critic &amp; Plausibility Validation: Evaluates physical plausibility, mass balance, and macronutrient density to veto impossible predictions before presenting to the user.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Calibrated Active Clarification: Fuses 7 pipeline signals into a calibrated reliability score; triggers up to 2 targeted questions per round (max 2 rounds) for ambiguous components.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Persistence &amp; Audit Trail: Persists complete execution provenance (model, prompt version, KB version, compute version) in SQLite/Chroma for 100 % deterministic re-runs.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="10" name="Shape 8"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6199632" y="1444752"/><a:ext cx="5440680" cy="4206240"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="roundRect"><a:avLst><a:gd name="adj" fmla="val 870"/></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F8F9FA"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="CBD5E1"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="11" name="Text 9"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6364224" y="1554480"/><a:ext cx="5111496" cy="310896"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2A8C8C"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Non-Functional Requirements (Quality &amp; Constraints)</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="12" name="Text 10"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6364224" y="1901952"/><a:ext cx="5111496" cy="3675888"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Accuracy &amp; Calibration Invariants: Must achieve component F1 ≥ 0.80, caloric MAPE ≤ 18 %, calorie MAE ≤ 90 kcal, and Expected Calibration Error (ECE ≤ 0.10) on weighed benchmark plates.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Performance &amp; Cost Budgets: Fast interactive execution targeting p50 latency ≤ 8 s and p95 ≤ 20 s on complex plates; compute API cost capped at ≤ $0.01 per meal analysis.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Offline Autonomy &amp; Mock Mode: MOCK_MODE=1 executes the entire pipeline offline without internet access or paid API keys, returning byte-for-byte identical, reproducible outputs for evaluation.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Grounding Integrity &amp; Zero Hallucination: 100 % of non-null displayed nutrients must trace back to published composition database records; zero generative AI in the calculation path.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Commodity Hardware Deployment: Runs CPU-only on a standard Windows laptop with 8 GB RAM using local SQLite (WAL mode) and Chroma storage; cold-start time ≤ 60 s.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Safety Scope &amp; Ethical Disclaimer: Informational self-tracking only; displays strict non-medical disclaimer on all views with zero clinical, prescription, or diagnostic claims.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1350"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Data Privacy &amp; Retention: User meal photographs and nutritional records are stored locally by default with full user-controlled deletion on demand.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="13" name="Shape 11"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="548640" y="5779008"/><a:ext cx="11094415" cy="475488"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="roundRect"><a:avLst><a:gd name="adj" fmla="val 9615"/></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F3F6FB"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="1F3C73"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="14" name="Text 12"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="777240" y="5779008"/><a:ext cx="10637215" cy="475488"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="ctr" indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill